# ---- Generated. Do not edit by hand; regenerate with `pnpm generate:api`. ----
# (Committed deliberately so CI can verify freshness — listed here as a reminder,
#  not ignored.)
# frontend/packages/api-client/src/generated/

# ---- AI design skills ----
# Skill CONTENT is committed (.agents/skills/**, .claude/skills/**/*.md) so the
# standard is pinned and reviewable. These are generated per-developer by
# scripts/setup.sh and must NOT be committed:
#   - settings.local.json : per-developer overrides
#   - skills/*/scripts/   : 12MB platform binaries + a 1MB generated font index
# NOTE: gitignore has no trailing comments — a "#" mid-line is part of the pattern.
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/skills/*/scripts/
.impeccable/cache/

# Sync-conflict copies — "Foo 2.cs" left beside "Foo.cs" by iCloud Desktop sync or Dropbox.
# .NET compiles every *.cs it finds, so committing one breaks every build that pulls it. Ignored
# so they cannot be staged by accident; the build (Directory.Build.props) and the /verify skill
# still report them, because a conflict copy can hold an edit that exists nowhere else.
* [0-9].*
* [0-9][0-9].*
# ---- Python (scripts/audit_dependencies.py and its tests) ----
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# ...and copied directories ("components 2/"), which iCloud leaves too.
* [0-9]/
* [0-9][0-9]/
